/* System-drawn strings. iOS reads these from the bundle, never from
   translations/*.json — the in-app flag cannot reach a permission
   alert the system puts up. The same keys stay in Info.plist as the
   fallback Apple requires; these are what actually ship, and the two
   are kept identical. */

"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Camera access is needed to scan QR codes for tunnel configuration import.";
